      "jp": "ある日の昼下がり。\n景色を楽しみながら湖畔を散歩していた僕は、\n木陰でぼーっとしているニグリュさんの姿を発見した。",
      "jp_sha256": "e545253ef15acca0e1c2f9c3a8b3a74687afac7456a2180f57d45ec9183a7423",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "어느 날 오후.\n풍경을 즐기며 호숫가를 산책하던 나는,\n나무 그늘에서 멍하니 있는 니그류 씨를 발견했다.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 8,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "31251835facc21592ca6c7a3a827378f07ad258ea836fc02aa39178a4aaa7b1e:000002_2738130307920651167:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ある日の昼下がり。\n景色を楽しみながら湖畔を散歩していた僕は、\n木陰でぼーっとしているニグリュさんの姿を発見した。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "7a6904fd140f190e6885c038e9716181b628c0984c4c0bd1dc8a9789bcb6e543",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "こんにちは、ニグリュさん。\nどうしたんですか？　どこか具合でも悪いんですか？",
      "jp_sha256": "6630b22395b0374646c43f6c5139d429fa150a0dc8aa7d37bc81e2f1dc8aa1aa",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "안녕하세요, 니그류 씨.\n왜 그러세요? 어디 몸이라도 안 좋은가요?",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "31251835facc21592ca6c7a3a827378f07ad258ea836fc02aa39178a4aaa7b1e:000002_2738130307920651167:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "こんにちは、ニグリュさん。\nどうしたんですか？　どこか具合でも悪いんですか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "ccd2b36939bd1d16902368e3ec6d83c1405c617830f8cc41242d1fea4ab72b37",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あ、ご主人くん。こんにちは。\n具合は普通だよ。平常運転、平常運転。\nいつも通り……楽になりたいなぁ、ってね。ふふ……。",
      "jp_sha256": "4ac5f56225c77cc9afd5da5c6dbbc4a6538d31427e75c2baefa3dc4d782b9e59",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아, 주인 군. 안녕.\n몸은 평범해. 정상 운전, 정상 운전.\n평소처럼…… 편해지고 싶네, 하고. 후후…….",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 20,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
